   "text": "user: \"my upload failed\" \u2192 find the trace_id\n\u2192 which span failed? \u2192 its input and error\n\nNotFoundError 404   \u2192 wrong model name in config\nInvalid JSON: EOF   \u2192 max_output_tokens too small\nrule errors           \u2192 bad scan or bad extraction\n\nthen: add it to the golden set",
